🛒 Overview

Catalyst Commerce is a modern frontend e-commerce project focused on creating a polished, responsive, and scalable shopping experience.

The project is structured around reusable interface components and a clean frontend architecture, making it easier to build, maintain, and extend an online-store experience.

The application is designed with a strong focus on:

🎨 Modern visual design

📱 Responsive layouts

🧩 Reusable UI components

⚡ Fast frontend development

🟦 Type-safe TypeScript code

🛍️ Product-focused experiences

✨ Clean and intuitive user interactions

🎯 Project Goals

The main goals of Catalyst Commerce are to create a professional e-commerce interface while demonstrating modern frontend development practices.

Core objectives

Build a responsive online-store interface

Create reusable product and UI components

Maintain a consistent visual design system

Organize frontend code for scalability

Provide a smooth shopping experience

Practice modern TypeScript-based development

Prepare the application for future commerce functionality

