🏗️ Application Architecture

Catalyst Commerce follows a component-oriented frontend architecture.

                    CATALYST COMMERCE
                           │
                           ▼
                  ┌──────────────────┐
                  │   Application    │
                  └────────┬─────────┘
                           │
          ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
          ▼                ▼                ▼
      Layouts          Components         Routes
          │                │                │
          ▼                ▼                ▼
      Navigation       Product UI       Store Pages
      Sections         Cards            Views
      Containers       Forms            Experiences
          │                │                │
          └────────────────┼────────────────┘
                           ▼
                  Responsive Storefront

This structure makes the project easier to extend as more commerce functionality is introduced.

