🎨 Design Principles

01 — Product First

The interface should make products easy to discover, understand, and interact with.

02 — Simplicity

Avoid unnecessary complexity and keep important actions clear.

03 — Consistency

Shared components should follow the same visual and interaction language.

04 — Responsiveness

The experience should remain usable across phones, tablets, laptops, and desktops.

05 — Reusability

Common UI patterns should be implemented as reusable components.

06 — Maintainability

The codebase should remain organized and understandable as features are added.

