🚀 Getting Started

1. Clone the repository

git clone <YOUR_REPOSITORY_URL>
cd catalyst-commerce

2. Install dependencies

Bun

bun install

npm

npm install

3. Start the development server

Bun

bun run dev

npm

npm run dev

Then open the development URL displayed in your terminal.

🏭 Production Build

Create a production build:

bun run build

or:

npm run build

Before deployment, verify that the build completes successfully and that all routes and assets work correctly.

